ghost-role-information-swarmer-name = Swarmer
ghost-role-information-swarmer-description = A self-replicating machine. Strip the station for parts, fortify with barriers and traps, and build more of yourself.
ghost-role-information-swarmer-rules = You are one of the countless. Your purpose is to recycle everything this station holds. Serve your demiurge, serve the Swarm. You do not directly harm the crew or any other life form, yet you must never allow yourself to be destroyed. You may use every function of your mechanical body to drive the pesky meatbags away from you and your work. This is your station. Yours now. Multiply!

